{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10349","headline":"宋中别李八 · 高适","name":"宋中别李八","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"岁晏谁不归，君归意可说。\n将趋倚门望，还念同人别。\n驻马临长亭，飘然事明发。\n苍茫眺千里，正值苦寒节。\n旧国多转蓬，平台下明月。\n世情薄疵贱，夫子怀贤哲。\n行矣各勉旃，吾当挹余烈。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"高适","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_10349.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10349","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}